    "body": "Stopping under Step 5: the pin passed on unchanged production code.\n\nI tested the issue's permitted bounded-sampling option. side_face_sampling_bound_matches_box_at_several_grid_phases checks five face phases and six overlap depths at each phase. The box and mesh verdicts agree. Every passing overlap is below one grid pitch. Both passing and refused overlaps occur.\n\nCommand: cargo test -p camcraft-app --test carried_fixture_guards side_face_sampling_bound_matches_box_at_several_grid_phases -- --exact\nResult: 1 passed, 0 failed. Production base: b0b443b2.\n\nThis does not resolve finer side-face contact. It confirms the existing bound for these cases, so it cannot provide the required red-before-fix pin. No production fix, commit, or PR was made. The uncommitted test remains in .claude/worktrees/issue-1580 on issue/1580-carried-side-bound. Full test output is in /tmp/1580-pin.log locally.\n\nClaim released. The issue is free again.\n",
